      en: ["Establishment of the Giraitės ginkluotės gamykla company in 2000", "The only factory in the Baltics producing NATO-standardized ammunition", "Production capacity of over 60 million rounds per year", "Certified under ISO 9001 for quality management and ISO 14001", "Export rate is approximately 90% of total production", "Military calibers include 5.56 mm, 7.62 mm, and .308 Winchester"],
