      en: ["Official opening in late 2019", "Initial investment exceeding 95 million EUR", "Located in the Kaunas Free Economic Zone", "Produces radar sensors and electronic control units", "LEED Gold certified for environmental efficiency", "Strategic partnership with Kaunas University of Technology"],
